sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant PayLink
    participant Payment
    participant Wallet as Wallet and Ledger
    participant Audit as Audit Log

    PayLink->>Payment: Request refund for payment reference
    Payment->>Payment: Check current state

    alt Payment is already Refunded
        Payment-->>PayLink: Return Refunded without another release

    else Payment is Failed
        Payment->>Wallet: Check held total for this payment

        alt Matching hold exists
            Wallet-->>Payment: Confirm held total and funding wallet

            critical Release funds and mark Refunded atomically and exactly once
                Payment->>Wallet: Release held total to funding wallet
                Wallet->>Wallet: Record immutable ledger entry
                Wallet->>Audit: Record release amount, wallet, payment, initiator, time and reason
                Wallet-->>Payment: Release recorded
                Payment->>Payment: Set Refunded
            end

            Payment-->>PayLink: Return Refunded

        else Matching hold cannot be confirmed
            Wallet-->>Payment: Report hold inconsistency
            Payment-->>PayLink: Keep Failed and report refund failure
        end

    else Payment is in another state
        Payment-->>PayLink: Refuse refund without changing state or balances
    end

    Note over Payment,Wallet: Release the bill amount plus service fee to the original funding wallet.
    Note over Payment,Wallet: Unknown payments must be confirmed Failed before a refund.